WEBVTT

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:04.400
<i>I don't want to die!</i>

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.770
<i>I don't want to die!</i>

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.780
<i>I don't want to die!</i>

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.650
<i>I don't want to die!</i>

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:15.480
I don't want to die!

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:50.940
Ow...

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:09.220
<i>Doesn't look like I have any broken bones.</i>

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:17.600
The moon's huge!

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:24.240
I don't want to say such a clichéd line...

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:32.820
but where am I?!

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.990
Mitsuha
Goes to Another World

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.920
<i>I was falling, wasn't I?</i>

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.920
<i>Yeah, I didn't make it, for sure.</i>

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.210
I fell...

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:13.650
With your academic performance, 
I thought you'd get into that university,

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.140
but you <i>have</i> been through a lot, Yamano...

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.000
An accident? Poor thing...

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.280
She got along so well 
with her older brother...

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.540
It must be rough for Mitsuha-chan.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.680
That's right. That's what happened.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.820
<i>How do I make sense of this situation?</i>

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:31.440
<i>I fell off a cliff! 
With a rocky shore below me!</i>

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:35.690
<i>What would Onii-chan make of this?</i>

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.940
It's got to be another world.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.200
<b>World
Splash</b>

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.200
A famous detective once said this.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.570
<b>\h\h\hIn-Depth Explanation of Firearm Mechanisms
\h\hMaster the Airsoft Gun
 Complete Guide to Customizing Compact Handguns</b>

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.570
<b>Jam-packed group poster
with this magazine's best anime</b>

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:45.610
"When you eliminate the 
impossible, whatever remains,

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:44.820
<b>Expert Starter Set</b>

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:48.230
however impossible, must be the truth."

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:52.450
Now, let's see where following 
that logic takes us.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.710
If you were already dead, 
you'd lack a sense of self.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:55.500
<b>Sanzu River</b>

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.590
<b>Sanzu River</b>

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:02.090
If you were unconscious and in a dream, 
you wouldn't feel pain, fatigue, or hunger.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.430
So what possibility remains?

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:10.470
It does seem like another world.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:14.970
There's no need to pinch my cheeks.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.700
The sensation is realistic.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.710
For now, let's find something to eat.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:30.270
I'll live on, on my family's behalf.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.880
Kell corole martonese...

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.000
A human...

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:35.340
The day before yesterday, I saw a rabbit.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:37.050
And yesterday, a deer.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:39.640
And today, you...

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.390
An unfamiliar ceiling.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.290
A temazem!

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.110
Kia nija?

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:59.390
I don't know what you're saying.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:01.350
Teloate ilom atanos.

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.250
Okok isata ayok.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:04.910
Imik era do?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.260
Racocoda atik?

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:11.220
This must be your house. 
So you saved me.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.820
This? So?

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:16.430
Thank you. I owe my life to you.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.560
Colette.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.690
Ia!

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.840
<i>Colette-chan, is it?</i>

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.070
Garah atiks?

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:29.060
Thanks...

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:42.200
<i>It tastes watery...</i>

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:51.180
<i>No, it's fine. It's edible, at least.</i>

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:55.460
<i>Hunger is the best seasoning, I guess.</i>

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.270
<i>Huh? Why am I getting déjà vu?</i>

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.910
You fool, don't eat so hurriedly!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:08.510
Your stomach won't be able to take it all.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:15.230
<i>Shut up! Gimme 12 hours 
and I'll be as fit as a jet plane!</i>

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:21.140
Huh? It's healed already...

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.450
How long was I asleep?

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.250
Long... was?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:31.010
How. Long. Was. I.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.300
<i>Not gonna work, huh?</i>

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.390
<i>Let's start with my name, at least.</i>

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:40.250
Colette.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.620
Mitsuha. Mitsuha.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.340
Mitsuha?

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:46.140
Mitsuha. Mitsuha.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:49.190
Colette. Mitsuha. Colette.

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:51.080
Mitsuha!

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.300
Mitsuha!

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.570
Uncle! Uncle! You're gonna break...

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.170
my spine!

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:01.000
Thanks for the food.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.960
Colette. Conulia?

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.420
Ia!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.880
Alo yattoan.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.500
Wotajira!

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:13.740
<i>Her father, then?</i>

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:16.950
<i>He doesn't even flinch 
at that superhuman hug.</i>

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.100
Izem urabat?

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.080
Ia, yumonat.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.270
Ia!

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.270
Ajum atemas.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.740
Iniesna.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:29.420
As uoki.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.040
Nahog inan chinok?

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.150
Gasonest!

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.930
Isel kushadoh!

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.710
Nad Obunishikoo.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.280
I'm back to full health...

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.550
<i>It feels more like the middle 
of nowhere than another world...</i>

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:35.830
<i>Ugh, my bladder's about to burst!</i>

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.970
<i>A fragrant scent...</i>

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.850
I guess a flush toilet 
was too much to ask for...

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:47.620
Where's the toilet paper?

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:54.310
The pocket tissues I always keep on hand 
for times like these really paid off!

00:09:54.310 --> 00:09:57.450
But isn't there anything 
I can do about this smell?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.160
I want to go to a 100-yen shop 
and buy a bathroom air freshener...

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.930
Like there'd be any here!

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.870
Mitsuha! Mitsuha!

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:07.120
No, I'm fine now...

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.130
I'm feeling better now!

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.030
See?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.010
Collecting edible plants?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.410
I'll help you.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.560
Achub satelaya.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.310
Telgar makstaya.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.980
Arated zumonat.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.390
Ey Kodezkam.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:37.710
<i>Birds... the fauna's not 
too different from Earth.</i>

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:39.360
Mitsuha!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.920
Raw wheat, raw rice, raw egg.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:49.530
Mom strips, mom strip, mom nude.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:51.960
That's one sexy mom...

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.270
Terot!

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.150
Oh, you're good at this!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.300
Nuk ahelos.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:05.220
What was it? Er, that's...

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.030
"Not edible", right?

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:08.200
Ia!

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:14.400
This is what it's like to care 
for a little sister.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.980
You must protect little sisters 
with your life.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:22.570
That dog was on a leash, you know.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:24.490
What about this?

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.790
Uryuk ahelos.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.470
"Uryuk", which means it's edible?

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.750
Ia!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.390
I've gotten the hang of telling them apart.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:37.840
Kell corole martonese.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:40.430
Huh? Um, what was it...

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:43.800
"Dangerous animals... close by?!"

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.570
Wolves!

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:53.270
Wolves move in packs.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.980
So maybe they're stray wolves, or rather...

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:59.070
A parent and its cubs? 
Is the big one their mother?

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.560
On their way back 
to her parents' after a divorce?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.010
Not good... what do we do?

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:10.890
<i>I've got to protect Colette-chan, 
no matter what!</i>

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:18.320
<i>With her strength, 
she should be able to cling on...</i>

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.760
Climb up! Hurry!

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:33.160
I'm not good at climbing trees. So long!

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:36.690
Mitsuha! Mitsuha!

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.150
<i>I'm scared...</i>

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:47.490
<i>A rock... can I use it as a weapon?</i>

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.230
<i>No! I don't want to die!</i>

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:52.500
<i>Help me!</i>

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.920
<i>Onii-chan!</i>

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.920
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:02.960
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.180
<i>I'm scared...</i>

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.770
<i>A rock... can I use it as a weapon?</i>

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.530
<i>No! I don't want to die!</i>

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.730
<i>Help me!</i>

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:25.360
Huh? It's Onii-chan's room.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.070
<b>World
Splash</b>

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.240
Is this our house?

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:26.530
<b>Expert Starter Set</b>

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.570
Where's the forest? The wolves?

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:30.620
A dream?

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.710
It wasn't a dream.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.120
I have to help her!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.010
Don't take this slingshot lightly.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.780
This baby packs a punch on par 
with a .22 caliber pistol!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:43.710
<i>There it is, his airsoft trivia!</i>

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.630
These are steel pellets made for penetration.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.480
A real man's marbles 
for taking enemies head-on!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.150
<i>Getting real close 
to sexual harassment there!</i>

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:53.360
A folding knife for a father to pass 
onto his son as a manly tool!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.390
Its high utility lends it a powerful presence!

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.900
In other words, it's a pocket knife, right?

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.550
Mitsuha...

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.530
Pepper

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.530
<b>Shichimi
Togarashi</b>

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:14.780
<i>If there's a connection to that other world,</i>

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:17.080
<i>I should be able to return 
to where Colette-chan is.</i>

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:19.800
<i>Go back?</i>

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:23.090
<i>Even though I might die for real this time?</i>

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:26.880
<i>I managed to come home, 
so why do I have to go back there?!</i>

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.470
What reason do I have?!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:35.770
Huh? You need a reason to save a cute girl?

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:42.420
Yeah, yeah, yeah. I get it.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.730
You annoying, pain-in-the-butt,

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:46.780
Onii-chan who I love!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.080
Over here, wolves!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.080
Mitsuha!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.080
Take this!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.520
Spice bomb!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.700
Mitsuha!

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:40.320
I did it, Onii-chan...

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:46.210
Mitsuha! Mitsuha!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:49.090
Mitsuha! Mitsuha!

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.950
An <i>unfamilite</i> ceiling...

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.180
What was that?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.900
No, I didn't misspeak.

00:15:57.900 --> 00:16:00.680
It's a cross between 
"white" and "unfamiliar".

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:03.390
Wait, who? What? Where?!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.670
Looks like this language will suffice.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.910
Huh? A lucky cat?

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:10.610
The one Onii-chan gave me!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.110
Or so it would seem.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:13.900
But the reality is...

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:16.370
I am the one you tore away at.

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:18.550
Tore away?

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:19.860
Indeed.

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:22.610
So, what exactly are you, anyway?

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:23.960
Some kind of god?

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.520
Not exactly.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:30.390
I am a being who, in the distant past,
evolved into a life form made of pure energy.

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.190
Sure...

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:34.050
I have traversed a myriad of worlds, 
and by their observation,

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.460
gained the concept of "enjoyment".

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:41.400
I don't really get it, but it 
sounds pretty amazing, at least.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:42.730
However!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.650
One time, as I wandered a certain world,

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.330
I was suddenly besieged 
by an intense feeling of displeasure.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.610
And you were its cause.

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.580
Displeasure, you say...

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:56.480
With your powerful thought 
energy of, "I don't want to die!",

00:16:56.480 --> 00:17:00.170
you managed to tear off 
a part of my mind energy.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.000
You mean back then!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.360
Verily!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.750
And that portion you tore off 
fused with your mind,

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:13.210
so seamlessly that forcibly removing it 
would leave you in a vegetative state.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:15.860
What? So you mean it's harmful in some way?!

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:16.770
Nope!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:18.680
However...

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.470
H-However?

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:23.980
It seems you've acquired the ability 
to traverse between worlds.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.430
A-Acquired?

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:28.190
Yes. It's been added on.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.430
Wh-What'd you say?!

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:36.870
So that's why I can come and go 
between Earth and Colette-chan's world?

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.820
Yes. If you can specify an exact location,

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:41.910
you can jump worlds at will.

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:46.060
That sounds like a pretty amazing ability!

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:50.130
Oh, yeah, it seems that my 
wounds heal quickly, as well.

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:53.340
It appears as though you've 
acquired healing abilities, too.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:58.010
Even if you lose an arm, it would 
regenerate in about a month's time.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.230
Seriously?!

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:01.630
Or it might take three months.

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:04.170
Which is it?! 
Well, I'm fine so long as it heals.

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:07.440
Do you have any further questions 
or requests for me?

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.910
Requests? Let me think...

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:16.080
Language...

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:18.490
How about an ability to understand 
unfamiliar languages?

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.680
Yes. So be it.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:24.780
I shall make it so you can transfer linguistic
knowledge from those you speak with.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.540
And thus ends my explanation.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.670
Enjoy a life of good health!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.970
Hold on a minute!

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:36.290
When the stars have spun some 
tens of thousands of times,

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:39.010
I'll come and see how you're doing!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.330
Wait, do you mean rotations? Or revolutions?

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:43.560
Either way, I won't be alive that long!

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:47.240
Mitsuha! You've come to!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.680
<i>Colette-chan...</i>

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.990
I'm so glad!

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:53.510
You wouldn't wake up, so I was afraid 
that you might never open your eyes!

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.460
<i>I can completely understand what she's saying.</i>

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:01.200
Thank you. Looks like 
you tended to my wounds.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.450
Mitsuha, you can speak...

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.910
Y-Yeah...

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.670
It looks like I've regained 
my lost memories.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:13.610
I'm so glad...

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:15.880
I'm so glad!

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:16.840
Stop, stop, it hurts, it hurts, my ribs!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.370
Thanks for the food.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:25.500
There aren't any kids her age around here, 
so I hope you can become friends.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.680
<i>We're not close in age at all...</i>

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.750
Mitsuha.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.050
Thank you for saving my daughter.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.090
What's this?

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.650
The payment for the wolf.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:38.650
Everyone in the village is grateful 
that you slew the wolf.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.250
What?

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:42.520
The wolf was harvested 
for its meat, fangs, and pelt.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:46.080
I finished off the smaller ones 
that had collapsed.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.870
Those rights and payment 
belongs to you, Mitsuha.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.360
This is... gold?

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.530
Huh? You don't know about money?

00:19:56.530 --> 00:20:00.800
Well, you see, it's different 
from my country's money.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:05.430
Er, what can I buy 
with this coin, and how many?

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:15.340
<i>So I can freely travel 
between this world and Earth...</i>

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.030
What would Onii-chan do in my shoes?

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:23.130
This other world is a frontier!

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.510
Frontier...

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:26.720
Cheat abilities exist to be used.

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.040
You're right.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.580
If I live life on Earth as I always have...

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.540
My parents left behind a decent inheritance,

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:38.910
but for university, it'd be pretty tough 
paying for four years of tuition and so on.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.370
Gotta work if you want to 
hold on to that money!

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:44.830
But it's not like I have any careers 
I'm particularly interested in...

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:50.590
There's gold to be had here, as well.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:54.500
The societies in this world 
are fairly undeveloped.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:56.520
If I could bring manufactured 
goods from Earth here...

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:57.310
Bingo!

00:20:57.310 --> 00:21:00.050
If I obtain goods from Earth 
and sell them in this world...

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.320
Oh, what wonderful alchemy... no, liquidity!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.000
I've won!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.570
Don't get overly optimistic.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.560
Yeah.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:12.090
World jumping is a cheat ability, but I might 
suddenly become unable to use it.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:12.730
Yeah.

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.040
I need to secure enough funds

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.540
so that it's okay, 
even if I get stuck in either world!

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.810
How much?

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.170
<b>Balance</b>

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:27.090
Well, if I had one billion, I could 
probably live to be 100 in good comfort.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.800
So for both worlds, 
that's two billion yen in total!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.410
For that I need gold!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.230
Tens of thousands of gold coins!

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.700
Yes! Gold!

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:39.750
Okay! This is where the ambitions 
of Yamano Mitsuha begin!

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:44.080
<i>In preparation for my happy, 
peaceful retirement,</i>

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:47.500
<i>I'm going to save up two billion yen's 
worth of gold in another world!</i>

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:08.890
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold
in Another World 
for My Retirement</b>
